# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Box of Scraps — .gitignore
#
# This repository is PUBLIC and its working folder sits inside a synced OneDrive
# tree, so these rules lean towards keeping things out. The negations at the
# bottom are what guarantee a fresh clone can still build and run.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────
# dist/ holds the ~120 MB one-file exe; it ships as a release asset, never here.
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.manifest

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyd
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── Virtual environments ─────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Secrets — nothing here may ever be committed ──
# The update-signing private key is meant to live outside this folder entirely;
# these patterns are the safety net for the day one gets saved here by mistake.
# The signing PUBLIC key belongs in the source and is deliberately not matched.
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.asc
*.gpg
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk
signing*
*private*
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.*
credentials.*
*.token
token.txt
.netrc
_netrc

# ── Executables and updater leftovers ────────
# The app renames itself during a self-update, so a built exe run from this
# folder drops these beside itself.
*.exe
*.exe.old
*.exe.sha256
*.old
.*.new.tmp

# ── Editors / tooling ────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Windows / OneDrive litter ────────────────
# OneDrive writes desktop.ini into synced folders and forks a "conflicted copy"
# when the same file is edited on two machines — neither belongs in git.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*conflicted copy*
*-DESKTOP-*
.DS_Store

# ── Scratch / throwaway ──────────────────────
# Verification scripts get written, run, and deleted (see CLAUDE.md); these
# catch the ones that outlive their session.
_md_probe.py
*_probe.py
scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.log
v.txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED FOR A WORKING CLONE — these stay tracked no matter what lands above.
#
# BoxOfScraps.spec is the build recipe and was previously swallowed by the
# "*.spec" rule. It survived only because it was already tracked, so removing it
# once would have silently broken every future build from a clean clone. The
# PNGs are bundled into the exe by that spec, and icon.ico is the app icon and
# its dev-mode window icon.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
!BoxOfScraps.spec
!owl_source.png
!logo_b.png
!splash_static.png
!icon.ico
!File.py
!make_icon.py
!release.py
!CLAUDE.md
!.gitignore
